<%
;;;;
;;;; Template for a PlantUML diagram of the C4 Views
;;;; (system landscape, context, container, component, dynamic and deployment views)
;;;;
;;;; The rendering of the single elements is implemented in the
;;;; lib.plantuml.c4 namespace by the multimethod render-c4-element,
;;;; which can be extended or overridden to customize the diagram.
;;;;
;;;; config:
;;;;  :per-element true
;;;;  :id-as-name  true
;;;;
(require '[lib.plantuml.c4 :as c4])
%><%= (str/join "\n" (c4/render-c4-view model e)) %>

' (generated by Overarch with template <%= (:template ctx) %>)
